WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.424 line:73%
Ano ba talaga ang ginagawa
ng solar panels mo?

c02
00:00:03.774 --> 00:00:06.544 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.894 --> 00:00:10.864 line:73%
Simple lang: liwanag ng
araw ang tumatama sa panels.

c04
00:00:10.964 --> 00:00:13.574 line:73%
Ginagawa itong DC na
kuryente ng solar cells.

c05
00:00:13.824 --> 00:00:17.074 line:73%
Pero AC ang gamit ng
appliances sa bahay.

c06
00:00:17.174 --> 00:00:21.584 line:73%
Kaya may inverter:
ginagawa nitong AC ang DC.

c07
00:00:21.834 --> 00:00:25.724 line:73%
Habang may araw, solar ang
tumutulong sa bahay mo.

c08
00:00:26.024 --> 00:00:30.134 line:73%
Kapag kulang o gabi na,
grid o battery ang sasalo.

c09
00:00:30.434 --> 00:00:36.464 line:73%
Panels, inverter, at tamang
setup. 'Yan ang solar!

cz1
00:00:36.864 --> 00:00:42.714 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:43.064 --> 00:00:45.524 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
